1
00:00:00,619 --> 00:00:03,519
(Penny:)This is kind of creepy.

2
00:00:03,522 --> 00:00:05,292
(Sheldon:)We're not supposed to
talk during this part.

3
00:00:05,291 --> 00:00:07,921
(Clerk:)Sorry.

4
00:00:13,866 --> 00:00:16,736
(Penny:)This is kind of creepy.

5
00:00:16,736 --> 00:00:18,536
(Penny:)Do you want to stop?

6
00:00:18,537 --> 00:00:20,407
(Penny:)I know you have trouble
with eye contact.

7
00:00:20,406 --> 00:00:23,846
(Sheldon:)Well, you have a brown fleck

8
00:00:23,843 --> 00:00:26,043
(Sheldon:)in your right iris that looks

9
00:00:26,045 --> 00:00:29,715
(Sheldon:)like a Formula One race car.

10
00:00:29,715 --> 00:00:33,685
(Sheldon:)So... I'm just
concentrating on that.

11
00:00:33,686 --> 00:00:37,256
(Sheldon:)Plus, it's easier around people
that I'm comfortable with.

12
00:00:37,256 --> 00:00:40,996
(Penny:)Aw, sweetie,
I'm comfortable around you, too.

13
00:00:40,993 --> 00:00:43,593
(Sheldon:)Of course you are,
I'm warm and soothing.

14
00:00:45,431 --> 00:00:48,261
(Sheldon:)I'm like a human bowl
of tomato soup.

15
00:00:48,267 --> 00:00:51,337
(Penny:)I meant more like
a little brother.

16
00:00:51,337 --> 00:00:53,437
(Sheldon:)Oh.

17
00:00:53,439 --> 00:00:56,309
(Sheldon:)Well, I suppose I do think
of you as a sister.

18
00:00:58,144 --> 00:01:00,844
(Sheldon:)And sometimes, a mother.

